  "notes": [
    "Gen 9 singles, minimized from Nightly 155's m8-gen9-singles-s1505-002. Under Shroodle's Desolate Land, Terrakion's Liquid Voice makes its Echoed Voice Water, and the strong weather stops it (`-fail|…|Echoed Voice|[from] Desolate Land`). Echoed Voice's own `onTryMove` (`singleEvent('TryMove', move)`) runs before the `TryMove` event's handlers, the weather's included, so the field's echoedvoice condition starts all the same (DESIGN.md R-M8-181)."
